{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angie, a 21-year-old woman, must face the unexpected loss of her father and embark on a journey back to Oniria \u2014 a deserted village in Spain \u2014 to recover the chain he left for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.poster.avif?t=1768215766\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.webm?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.mp4?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grief and loss accompany her from the start, but in Oniria, these burdens feel even heavier. The trauma from her past and painful memories of her childhood  linger around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oniria, located in the north of Arag\u00f3n, is deeply affected by rural exodus. It seems cursed by misfortune and suffering, or so the remaining villagers believe. They turn to religion for solace, using it to ward off what they see as bad omens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angy has always considered these superstitions to be ridiculous \u2014 just excuses to uphold outdated and harmful traditions. But ever since her return, she can't shake the feeling that someone is watching her. Soon, she'll realize that in Oniria, fear and nightmares can claw their way into reality.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Angy on her adventure. Decide if she keeps running from her fears, or if she finally faces them. Together, will you discover Oniria's dark secret, or will you be consumed in the process?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  ---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oniria is a first-person psychological horror game with a retro aesthetic. Explore the village by solving puzzles and evading the strange presence that haunts it. Experience Angy's present in 3D, and uncover her hidden memories in 2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.poster.avif?t=1768215766\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.webm?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.mp4?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727380?t=1768215766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727380?t=1768215766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/3f8f0aada8e4f1f525bdff2d9ca364144faab229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768215766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/3f8f0aada8e4f1f525bdff2d9ca364144faab229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768215766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3822470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angie, a 21-year-old woman, must face the unexpected loss of her father and embark on a journey back to Oniria \u2014 a deserted village in Spain \u2014 to recover the chain he left for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.poster.avif?t=1768215766\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.webm?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/e2bc7318ac9d77accd2b82ea75b1c200.mp4?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grief and loss accompany her from the start, but in Oniria, these burdens feel even heavier. The trauma from her past and painful memories of her childhood  linger around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oniria, located in the north of Arag\u00f3n, is deeply affected by rural exodus. It seems cursed by misfortune and suffering, or so the remaining villagers believe. They turn to religion for solace, using it to ward off what they see as bad omens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angy has always considered these superstitions to be ridiculous \u2014 just excuses to uphold outdated and harmful traditions. But ever since her return, she can't shake the feeling that someone is watching her. Soon, she'll realize that in Oniria, fear and nightmares can claw their way into reality.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Angy on her adventure. Decide if she keeps running from her fears, or if she finally faces them. Together, will you discover Oniria's dark secret, or will you be consumed in the process?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  ---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oniria is a first-person psychological horror game with a retro aesthetic. Explore the village by solving puzzles and evading the strange presence that haunts it. Experience Angy's present in 3D, and uncover her hidden memories in 2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.poster.avif?t=1768215766\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.webm?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/extras/cabff062fc2ceee7e5f6d2f5acda8782.mp4?t=1768215766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Frog Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727380/ac5